%% Master load status architecture (INTERNAL)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Unassigned
  Unassigned --> Assigned: dispatcher assigns driver and truck
  Assigned --> Accepted: driver accepts
  Assigned --> Unassigned: driver rejects (reason)
  Accepted --> EnRouteToPickup
  EnRouteToPickup --> AtPickup: geofence or manual confirm
  AtPickup --> Loaded: BOL captured and signed
  Loaded --> InTransit
  InTransit --> AtDelivery: geofence or manual confirm
  AtDelivery --> Delivered
  Delivered --> PODSubmitted
  PODSubmitted --> Completed: carrier review
  Completed --> Invoiced
  Invoiced --> Settled
  Settled --> Closed
  Closed --> [*]
